# text = When you excited my desire to devote myself to the office whose garb I bear , you spoke to me of the holy life of men resigning themselves to knowledge -- you have given me for companions an ignorant and sensual herd , who have no knowledge but that of the grossest frauds ; you spoke to me of men sacrificing the earthlier pleasures to the sublime cultivation of virtue -- you place me amongst men reeking with all the filthiness of vice ; you spoke to me of the friends , the enlighteners of our common kind -- I see but their cheats and deluders !
