# text = First , then , be sure , from the rising of the evening star , that thou leavest the garden-gate somewhat open , so that the demon may feel himself invited to enter therein ; and place fruits and water near the gate as a sign of hospitality ; then , three hours after twilight , come here with a bowl of the coldest and purest water , and thou shalt learn all , according to the Thessalian lore my mother taught me .
