# text = I saw the table set out ; but the gate I am sure was shut : depend upon it , that Calenus entered by the garden , and naturally closed the door after him But it was not locked Yes ; for I myself , angry at a negligence which might expose the bronzes in the peristyle to the mercy of any robber , turned the key , took it away , and -- as I did not see the proper slave to whom to give it , or I should have rated him finely -- here it actually is , still in my girdle Oh , merciful Bacchus !
